  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pubblication of the 2nd Research on Trafficking in Mozambique and Partner Strenghtening on PCM/MEAL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is part of the campaign to prevent and tackle trafficking in human beings, organs and human body parts in Mozambique.  
With the previous Project MOZ364  a research in the northern provinces of Mozambique has been carried out to better understand the characteristics of this phenomenon. 
With this short Project (4 months) we are aiming at publishing and launching the above mentioned research and at the same time to properly design a future broader Project that will be focused on prevention and awareness activities.</narrative>
  </description>
